   "roundness": null,
   "text": "named cost (ledger row 3,\nRED): a per-piece push is\nnow a two-commit pair; a\nforgotten refresh costs one\nextra local round.\n\na push touching nothing the\nrender reads compares equal\nand passes untouched.",
