   },
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "DEFECT FOUND: actions/checkout@v4 defaults to DEPTH 1.\nthe renderer derives landed pieces from git log trailers -\na shallow checkout sees ONE commit, derives an emptier model,\nand refuses EVERY push. the fix ships with this slice:\ncheckout gains fetch-depth: 0.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "r1037",
   "originalText": "DEFECT FOUND: actions/checkout@v4 defaults to DEPTH 1.\nthe renderer derives landed pieces from git log trailers -\na shallow checkout sees ONE commit, derives an emptier model,\nand refuses EVERY push. the fix ships with this slice:\ncheckout gains fetch-depth: 0.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "t1039",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1320,
   "y": 1034,
   "width": 204.60000000000002,
   "height": 90.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e03131",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0039",
   "seed": 17273,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 33507,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1785400000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "gen": "kerd"
   },
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "same bug class as the 0.71.1\nabsolute-REPO refusal: local\nverifies pass in an environment\nCI doesn't have. the progress\nselftest never noticed - its\nfixtures build their own trees.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
