   "roundness": null,
   "text": "read from the toolkit 2026-08-04: ids counter-based, seeds\narithmetic (10000 + n*7) \u00b7 no random, no time/date anywhere \u00b7\nevery output-feeding glob sorted() \u00b7 REPO root-independent since\n0.71.1 \u00b7 SVG text metrics are pure arithmetic, no font query.",
